Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Japanese credits timing
Applies after 0050-italian-ending-tilemap.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

The Japanese credits have 45 pages of 5 entries (tools/localize_japanese.py
rebuilds src/data/credits.h from the ROM) instead of 55. The Japanese ROM
shows each page for 156 frames instead of 115, so that the credits end with
their music; the scene changes keep the decomp's PAGE_COUNT / 9 spacing.

--- a/src/credits.c
+++ b/src/credits.c
@@ -730,6 +730,14 @@
 #define tCurrentPage data[2]
 #define tDelay       data[3]
 
+#if defined(PORT_BRIDGE) && GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_JAPANESE
+// The Japanese credits have 45 pages instead of 55, and the Japanese ROM shows
+// each page longer, so that the credits still last as long as their music.
+#define CREDITS_PAGE_DELAY 156
+#else
+#define CREDITS_PAGE_DELAY 115
+#endif
+
 static void Task_UpdatePage(u8 taskId)
 {
     int i;
@@ -792,7 +800,7 @@
     case 3:
         if (!gPaletteFade.active)
         {
-            gTasks[taskId].tDelay = 115;
+            gTasks[taskId].tDelay = CREDITS_PAGE_DELAY;
             gTasks[taskId].tState++;
         }
         return;
